{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1140300897"}, "name":{"label":"Hannes D.."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-08T15:01:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"143"}, "id":{"label":"13114954348"}, "title":{"label":"Absolut Scam"}, "content":{"label":"This service is a complete scam. They offer a so-called “Lifetime Subscription” which is nothing more than a trap – once you pay, there is no way to get a refund, no matter the circumstances. It’s outrageous that a company in the digital age can lock people into such one-sided and unfair conditions. Avoid at all costs – don’t waste your money here.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
